⍝ D-77: an empty box keeps its prototype
🍎> H←0⍴⊂1 2 3
🍎> ⍴H
⍝ expect: 0
🍎> ≡H
⍝ expect: 2
🍎> ↑H
⍝ expect: 0 0 0
🍎> 2↑H
⍝ expect: (0 0 0) (0 0 0)
🍎> H≡0⍴⊂4 5 6
⍝ expect: 1
🍎> H≡0⍴⊂'abc'
⍝ expect: 0
🍎> ''≡⊃⊂''
⍝ expect: 1
⍝ errors in GNU APL's order:  rank, then domain, then range;  an integer outside the axis is an INDEX ERROR
🍎> V←10 20 30
🍎> V[1;2]
⍝ refuse: %rank-error
🍎> 5[0.5]
⍝ refuse: %rank-error
🍎> V[0.5]
⍝ refuse: %domain-error
🍎> V[¯1]
⍝ refuse: %index-error
🍎> V[1E30]
⍝ refuse: %index-error
🍎> V[2.0]
⍝ expect: 20
🍎> V[2-0]
⍝ expect: 20
🍎> M←2 2⍴⍳4
🍎> ⌽[1E10]M
⍝ refuse: %axis-error
🍎> M+['a']M
⍝ refuse: %axis-error
🍎> ⌽[1 2]M
⍝ refuse: %axis-error
🍎> +/[1][2]M
⍝ refuse: %syntax-error
🍎> ⍎''
⍝ refuse: %value-error
🍎> ⌹4
⍝ expect: 0.25
🍎> ⌹0
⍝ refuse: %domain-error
